{"unit_id":"contraliz__dsh-occlick#card-zh","repo":"contraliz/dsh-occlick","commit":"814bbc0b0e0253f4f90d99ba9753941542fe26e1","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-occlick 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的提示音插件。它在设置页和插件配置页提供三个独立选择器，为回合完成、权限请求和回合错误选择 OpenCode 音效，并可在选择时试听或设为静音。客户端根据 Session 运行状态及审批、错误事件播放提示音，同时抑制停止操作、子会话和短暂状态变化造成的提示。适合希望在离开屏幕时听到 DSH 需要关注或已完成工作的用户；偏好保存在当前浏览器中。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:236-282","src/client.js:285-405","src/client.js:473-520"]}
{"unit_id":"contraliz__dsh-occlick#card-en","repo":"contraliz/dsh-occlick","commit":"814bbc0b0e0253f4f90d99ba9753941542fe26e1","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-occlick adds sounds to the DSH Web client. Settings offer separate, previewable alerts for completed turns, permission requests, and errors, plus mute controls. It filters stopped turns, subagents, and brief state changes; preferences stay in browser storage.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:236-282","src/client.js:285-405","src/client.js:473-520"]}
