{"unit_id":"contraliz__dsh-occlick#feature-1","repo":"contraliz/dsh-occlick","commit":"814bbc0b0e0253f4f90d99ba9753941542fe26e1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-occlick 的功能「提示音选择与试听」：在设置页或插件配置页分别为回合完成、权限请求和错误选择音效，也可关闭单个频道；变更选择时立即试听。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:236-282","src/client.js:301-325"]}
